{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o126a","title":"追奖宣隆秦洁子任骑都尉","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o126a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"追奖宣隆秦洁子任骑都尉","evidence":["shaodi-e-o126a-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":257,"label":"秋八月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y257","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o117","basis":"秋八月"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o126a-q","shaodi-q-o117","shaodi-q-b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o126a-q","source_order":[4,532,"O126a"],"order":1191}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o126a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-e6a31135d2fc9ce3c4fd","layer":"original","quote":"秋八月，诏曰：“昔燕剌王谋反〖33〗，韩谊等谏而死〖34〗，汉朝显登其子。诸葛诞创造凶乱〖35〗，主簿宣隆、部曲督秦洁秉节守义〖36〗，临事固争，为诞所杀；所谓无比干之亲而受其戮者〖37〗。其以隆、洁子为骑都尉，加以赠赐；光示远近，以殊忠义。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":531,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":122,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：甘露二年（公元 257 ）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":535,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4dd98e402a6a8de51491","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o117","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-d021e0b00f489a01f208","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月〖1〗，青龙现温县井中。三月，司空卢毓薨。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":522,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unico